From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EvilMetaMonkey <hood.mj85@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:11:06 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dmc doctor checks agent hooks

For each dmc hook entry, doctor reports a dmc executable that is missing
or not executable, an entry pointing at a different dmc build than the
one running, and a Muse Code Interrupt hook that is not async; and an
agent checkpoint left open longer than --stale-hours (default 2) by a
session that looks ended (its transcript idle as long, or none found).
Each finding comes with the fix (dmc disable / hooks install, or
checkpoint close / release). Doctor never changes hooks or checkpoints.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
